    "title": "Stater Bros. Markets",
    "description": "Stater Bros. Markets. Fresh. Affordable. Community First.\r\nThe Stater Bros. Markets app lets you to skip the line and shop anywhere, save shopping lists, redeem digital deals, and more!\r\n\r\nWhy Download the Stater Bros. Markets App?\r\n\r\nOnline Ordering & Curbside Pickup\r\nShop your grocery list and easily find what you need without having to browse the aisle. When your order is ready, just park in the designated spots and we'll bring your order to your car!\r\n\r\nGrocery Delivery\r\nOrder your groceries from the comfort of your home! All of your favorites from your local Stater Bros. carefully delivered to your door.*\r\n*Restrictions and fees may apply.\r\n\r\nFeatures with your time and convenience in mind:\r\n\r\nStore Locator\r\nFind a Stater Bros. Markets close to you with the features you need.\r\n\r\nReal-time Order Tracking\r\nReceive live order notifications on your phone and track your order in real-time.\r\n\r\nReorder your past orders\r\nSave time by reordering items from your previous orders.\r\n\r\nBuild a Shopping List\r\nCreate your own shopping lists to speed up your grocery shopping. Share your lists and favorite finds with your friends and family!\r\n\r\nBarcode Scanner\r\nCan't find a product? Use our in-app barcode scanner to find it.",
